# Third-party binaries — not project source. The ffmpeg/upscale pipeline was
# removed from the app (see GATELOG "Post-Handoff Maintenance Pass"), so
# these are unused leftovers; they're also individually >100MB, which GitHub
# rejects outright. If you ever need ffmpeg again, download it fresh rather
# than committing it.
bin/
ffmpeg-*/
ffmpeg-*.7z
*.7z

# Scratch HTML dumps captured while developing/debugging scrapers and
# adapters — not project source, and may contain embedded third-party
# credentials pulled from whatever page was saved (GitHub push protection
# flagged a Google OAuth Client ID/Secret in one of these). Never commit them.
page_dump.html
CustomAdapters/**/page_dump.html

# Alembic (don't ignore versions — they're source-controlled)
